# <%= props.projectName %>

A [React Native](https://reactnative.dev) app built with [Expo](https://expo.dev).

## Get started

1. Install dependencies

   ```bash
   <%= props.packageManager === 'bun' ? 'bun install' : props.packageManager === 'pnpm' ? 'pnpm install' : props.packageManager === 'yarn' ? 'yarn install' : 'npm install' %>
   ```

2. Start the app

   ```bash
   <%= props.packageManager === 'bun' ? 'bun start' : props.packageManager === 'pnpm' ? 'pnpm start' : props.packageManager === 'yarn' ? 'yarn start' : 'npm start' %>
   ```

In the output, you'll find options to open the app in a development client, a [development build](https://docs.expo.dev/develop/build/introduction/).

